</style></head><body><nav style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;padding:12px 20px;background:#e9f0f5;font:15px system-ui,sans-serif"><a href="https://github.com/RSIXDB/ContextArk/pull/44">全部内容 MR</a><a href="DESIGN-V2.html">完整架构</a><a href="DECISION-WORKBOOK.html">需审查决策的问题</a></nav><header><span class="badge">内部讨论 · 待人工填写 · PROPOSED</span><h1>ContextDB V2.5 架构决策讨论稿</h1><p>8组待决 · 43个具体问题 · 8项补充议题 · 16项已确认历史 · 8项仍待审的演进</p><p>编辑Markdown或Word，阅读本页；当前架构和验证状态按权威正文核对。</p><div class="downloads"><a href="https://github.com/RSIXDB/ContextArk/blob/64adc1f215218bb8b39a29fe7af4500b9c6c4d35/docs/architecture/hindsight/DECISION-WORKBOOK.md">编辑Markdown</a><a href="https://github.com/RSIXDB/ContextArk/blob/64adc1f215218bb8b39a29fe7af4500b9c6c4d35/docs/architecture/hindsight/DECISION-WORKBOOK.docx" download>下载可编辑Word</a><a href="DESIGN-V2.html">完整V2.5架构</a></div></header><div class="layout"><aside><strong>讨论导航</strong><label for="search">搜索问题或术语</label><input id="search" placeholder="例如：个人记忆、HC-05、RPO"><label for="view">阅读范围</label><select id="view"><option value="all">全部材料</option><option value="hc">当前待决</option><option value="extra">补充重要议题</option><option value="history">已决历史与方案演进</option><option value="guide">使用方法与汇总</option></select><button id="reset">显示全部</button><button id="print">打印当前视图</button><p id="count" class="hint" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="toc">
